{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23087","headline":"初除尚书郎脱刺史绯 · 白居易","name":"初除尚书郎脱刺史绯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亲宾相贺问何如，服色恩光尽反初。\n头白喜抛黄草峡，眼明惊拆紫泥书。\n便留朱绂还铃阁，却着青袍侍玉除。\n无奈娇痴三岁女，绕腰啼哭觅金鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}